---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="GS1 Digital Link & High-Speed Serialization | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Industrial 2D QR code serialization and GS1 Digital Link resolver pipeline for high-speed battery pack and cell production lines."
>
  <div class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-stone-600 uppercase tracking-widest bg-stone-100 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-stone-200">
          Serialization & Identification
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-tight mt-6 mb-6">
          High-Speed GS1 Digital Link & QR Serialization
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Article 13 of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 mandates that every battery pack carry a durable, legible 2D QR code linking to its passport. Our system delivers industrial-grade laser marking integration and global edge-resolved GS1 Digital Link URIs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Features -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 my-20">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🏷️</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">GS1 Standard URL Structure</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Standard format: <code class="text-stone-900 bg-stone-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">https://id.eudppprovider.com/01/GTIN/21/SERIAL</code>. Automatically resolves to machine-readable JSON-LD or human-friendly web portals based on HTTP Accept headers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">High-Throughput Line Integration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Direct TCP/IP and OPC-UA connectivity with industrial laser marking and thermal transfer labeling equipment (Keyence, Trumpf, Zebra) at 120+ packs per minute.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🌐</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Sub-50ms Global Resolver CDN</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            High-availability edge routing across European and global POPs guaranteeing instantaneous passport loading for European customs inspectors and end consumers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-12 rounded-3xl bg-stone-900 text-white text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Connect Your Manufacturing Lines</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-stone-300 max-w-xl mx-auto font-normal">
          Review our industrial serialization API guides and hardware compatibility matrix.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors">
          Talk to a Serialization Specialist &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
